*** how application can point to bootstrap plugin ***********
Make sure "lib" folder is inside "wwwroot" folder.
In _LayoutView.cshtml page we should add below code 
<header>
  <environment include="Developmemnt">    
    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/js/bootstrap.js"></script>
    <link href="~/lib/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  </environment>
</header>

